<title>UK: IBCA rates L-Bank's 10 bln peseta notes AAA L-term.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates L-Bank's 10 bln peseta notes AAA L-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Monday it assigned a long-term rating of AAA to the 10 billion peseta 7.25 percent notes due 2001 issued by Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttemburg.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of L-Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
